              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "Jbooshey"
            },
            "reviewBody": "Very good and the beer adds some needed carbonation. I made this in a pitcher with a 1/4 cup of the liquors and 1 1/2 cups of grenadine, a full bottle of New Glarus Spotted Cow and 3 cups of orange juice.",
            "datePublished": "2011-04-13T05:27:10.690Z"
